Ten Gauntlets facility - gauntlet 1 ("Little League"). Singles, 6v6, level
50, BST cap 420. All twelve pool teams plus the boss, Warden Helis - see
gauntlet-01.md for the full design rationale (each pool trainer is a
single-type specialist; the boss is a Dragon Dance Altaria sweep protected
by a team that clears its checks). AI flags match gauntlet-01.md's spec:
pool trainers get full offensive intelligence plus smart replacement
choice, no proactive switching, not omniscient; the boss additionally gets
omniscience and holds Altaria in reserve as its ace.
*/

